  "notes": [
    "This is a proposed schema, not proof of cloud provisioning.",
    "Native Appwrite row metadata $id is the record identifier; profile row IDs match auth user ID, pet_states row IDs match couple ID.",
    "Date-only values use YYYY-MM-DD varchar(10). All date-only input must be validated server-side.",
    "All server writes validate input lengths, membership, request replay and immutable response/adventure part semantics.",
    "Question bank content from historical migration 0007 requires separate audited seed, not fabricated users.",
    "Private memory photo bucket is a later resource and must be default-deny."
  ]
